<title>UK: Norway's Gullfaks crude to load 24 cargoes in June.</title>
<headline>Norway's Gullfaks crude to load 24 cargoes in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 24 standard 855,000 barrel cargoes in June, up one from May, traders said.</p>
<p>The total volume in June is expected to be 20.52 million barrels, up 855,000 barrels from May.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
